execute per plan","§2 write-bounding: 'one create per plan ... the only Jira mutations possible are the throwaway issue's create, its containment label/property, and its delete'","coordinate_full_create (create_route.py:171) already returns a CoordinatedCreateOutcome — re-feeding its plan to coordinate_and_fuse re-does the create rather than folding the existing outcome"],"finding":"§2's fuse step folds 'the create outcome' through batch_dispatch.coordinate_and_fuse, but coordinate_and_fuse takes ticket_plans + an execute seam and re-runs coordinator.coordinate internally, which would re-drive the plan through execute (a second physical create) — contradicting §2's stated one-create write-bounding invariant.","group_criteria":null,"group_id":null,"id":"fa8fe2fd7a219f0fb","impact":1.0,"is_primary":null,"location":"§2 — fuse bullet ('folded through PassFuse (pass_fuse.py) via batch_dispatch.coordinate_and_fuse over the throwaway outcome')","norm_id":"nd7143fa9624f5474","priority":1.0,"reason":"high-priority+criterion-opted-in","recalled":false,"scenarios":["Live run: coordinate_full_create creates issue A; coordinate_and_fuse then calls execute again on the same plan, creating a duplicate issue B — violating the shared-prod one-create bound and leaking a second issue the sweep may or may not catch"],"severity":"critical","suggested_fix":"Specify the fuse step as recording the existing CoordinatedCreateOutcome through PassFuse directly (fuse_mod.PassFuse(...).record(outcome) → CutoverReport), rather than re-invoking coordinate_and_fuse over the plan; if coordinate_and_fuse must be used, state explicitly that the execute seam passed to it is a no-op returning the already-observed key so no second create occurs.","tier":"LLM","validity":1.0,"verification":{"binary":{"absence_confirmed_in_context":"na","asserted_capability_confirmed":"yes","cited_reference_accurate":"yes","claims_absence":"na","committed_work_relies_on_unbacked_claim":"yes","current_state_satisfies_plan_goal":"no","evidence_entails_finding":"yes","impact_follows_necessarily":"yes","is_verifiable":"yes","no_existing_mitigation":"yes","no_viable_alternative_explanation":"yes","path_reachable":"yes","prerequisite_attribution_valid":"na","respects_artifact_altitude":"yes","severity_claim_justified":"yes"},"severity_attributes":{"ac_unverifiable":"none","blast_radius":"module","debt_impact":"medium","divergent_implementation":"contradicts_reality","dod_uncertifiable":"certification_cannot_prove","internal_conflict":"high","irreversible_without_rationale":"none","likelihood":"high","prod_impact":"medium","reversibility":"moderate","silent_vs_self_revealing":"self_revealing","undecomposed":"none","vague_directive":"none"}}},{"block_threshold":0.9,"blocking_enabled":true,"checklist_item":"- [ ] Reconcile the §2 fuse fold with coordinate_and_fuse's real contract (ticket_plans + execute, which re-runs the coordinator): either drive PassFuse directly over the already-produced create outcome, or specify how a single create is guaranteed (no second live mutation) if coordinate_and_fuse is used.","cohort":["T3"],"criteria":["T3"],"decision":"block","decision_margin":0.1,"drop_reason":null,"evidence":["Plan: 'folded through PassFuse (pass_fuse.py) via batch_dispatch.coordinate_and_fuse over the throwaway outcome'","batch_dispatch.py:314 signature: coordinate_and_fuse(ticket_plans, *, execute, ...)","batch_dispatch.py:336-338: report = coordinator.coordinate(ticket_plans, execute=execute, ...) — re-runs creates","Plan §2 write-bounding: 'one create per plan ... there is NO enumeration and NO inbound write-back'","MISMATCH: coordinate_and_fuse does not accept a CoordinatedCreateOutcome"],"finding":"The §2 fuse fold names an API that does not fold a pre-computed outcome: batch_dispatch.coordinate_and_fuse(ticket_plans, *, execute, ...) re-runs the coordinator (coordinator.coordinate(ticket_plans, execute=...)), so it cannot be driven 'over the throwaway outcome' already produced by coordinate_full_create, and feeding it ticket_plans+execute would trigger a SECOND live create — contradicting the plan's own one-create-per-plan write-bounding.","group_criteria":null,"group_id":null,"id":"f3c0394702bf386b1","impact":1.0,"is_primary":null,"location":"§2 — fuse bullet","norm_id":"n157ae25fad409374","priority":1.0,"reason":"high-priority+criterion-opted-in","recalled":false,"scenarios":["The live module tries to fold the outcome from coordinate_full_create through coordinate_and_fuse and finds the signature takes ticket_plans+execute, not an outcome","Wiring ticket_plans+execute into coordinate_and_fuse re-runs the coordinator and issues a second live create against shared prod"],"severity":"critical","suggested_fix":"Fold the create outcome through PassFuse directly (construct PassFuse + reclassify the single CoordinatedCreateOutcome) rather than via coordinate_and_fuse, or state that coordinate_and_fuse is invoked with an execute seam that returns the already-created key (no new mutation) and assert exactly-one physical create.","tier":"LLM","validity":1.0,"verification":{"binary":{"absence_confirmed_in_context":"na","asserted_capability_confirmed":"yes","cited_reference_accurate":"yes","claims_absence":"na","committed_work_relies_on_unbacked_claim":"yes","current_state_satisfies_plan_goal":"no","evidence_entails_finding":"yes","impact_follows_necessarily":"yes","is_verifiable":"yes","no_existing_mitigation":"yes","no_viable_alternative_explanation":"yes","path_reachable":"yes","prerequisite_attribution_valid":"na","respects_artifact_altitude":"yes","severity_claim_justified":"yes"},"severity_attributes":{"ac_unverifiable":"none","blast_radius":"module","debt_impact":"medium","divergent_implementation":"contradicts_reality","dod_uncertifiable":"certification_cannot_prove","internal_conflict":"high","irreversible_without_rationale":"none","likelihood":"high","prod_impact":"medium","reversibility":"moderate","silent_vs_self_revealing":"self_revealing"